    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Something like that. She found out he\u2019s one of Bradley\u2019s friends
      and they had a huge argument."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "She didn\u2019t know? Thought his group of assholes was pretty well known."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Nah, she goes to that all-girls school a few streets over, so she didn\u2019t
      know them. Or not enough to recognize \u2018em by their faces anyway, since
      she at least seemed to know about the rumours. Broke up immediately after."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: "Ah, so she figured out he\u2019s an incorrigible bully and dumped his
